      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Exploration of multiple regions of a bi-aryl amine template led to the identification of highly potent M(3) muscarinic acetylcholine receptor antagonists such as 14 (pA(2)=11.0) possessing good sub-type selectivity for M(3) over M(2). The structure-activity relationships (SAR) and optimization of the bi-aryl amine series are described."},
